  "The one-person business is humanity's oldest economic form: the craftsman, the trader, the artisan selling their own work. The leverage was always the constraint — one person's time, one person's output. Every later development in this database is about breaking that constraint: the solo craftsman with infinite leverage is the oldest dream in business.",
